/Title (Why These Metrics? Since the ad focuses on a relatable household problem, low pricing, and time-saving convenience, I would mainly look at engagement metrics \(Hook Rate, CTR\), conversion metrics \(Install Rate, CPI\), and business metrics \(Cost Per Booking\) to judge its performance.)
